<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Registrar Nuevo Profesor</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4">
    <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl w-full max-w-lg">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-center text-slate-900 mb-6">Registrar Nuevo Profesor</h1>

        {{#successMessage}}
        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 text-green-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl relative mb-4 text-xs font-semibold" role="alert">
            <span class="block sm:inline">{{successMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/successMessage}}

        {{#showTempPasswordAlert}}
        <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-800 p-5 rounded-xl relative mb-6 text-xs flex flex-col space-y-2 shadow-sm" role="alert">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-emerald-900 flex items-center space-x-1">
                <span>🎉</span> <span>¡Profesor Registrado con Éxito!</span>
            </h4>
            <p>Se ha creado una cuenta para <strong>{{profName}}</strong>.</p>
            <div class="bg-white border border-emerald-100 p-3 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-sm shadow-inner">
                <span class="select-all">Contraseña temporal: <strong class="text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-100/50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">{{tempPassword}}</strong></span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-[10px] text-emerald-600 font-medium leading-relaxed">
                ⚠️ Por favor, comparta esta contraseña de forma segura. Expira en 48 horas y se le obligará al docente a cambiarla en su primer inicio de sesión.
            </p>
        </div>
        {{/showTempPasswordAlert}}

        {{#errorMessage}}
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl relative mb-4 text-xs font-semibold" role="alert">
            <span class="block sm:inline">{{errorMessage}}</span>
        </div>
        {{/errorMessage}}

        <form action="/profesor/new" method="post" class="space-y-4">

            <div>
                <label for="nombre" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Nombre:</label>
                <input type="text" id="nombre" name="nombre" value="{{nombre}}" required
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="apellido" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Apellido:</label>
                <input type="text" id="apellido" name="apellido" value="{{apellido}}" required
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="correo" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Correo Electrónico:</label>
                <input type="email" id="correo" name="correo" value="{{correo}}" required
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="dni" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">DNI:</label>
                <input type="number" id="dni" name="dni" value="{{dni}}" required
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="telefono" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Teléfono (Opcional):</label>
                <input type="number" id="telefono" name="telefono" value="{{telefono}}"
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="direccion" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Dirección (Opcional):</label>
                <input type="text" id="direccion" name="direccion" value="{{direccion}}"
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div>
                <label for="cargo" class="block text-slate-600 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Cargo (Ej. Titular, Adjunto):</label>
                <input type="text" id="cargo" name="cargo" value="{{cargo}}"
                       class="w-full px-4 py-2 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 text-sm">
            </div>

            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-slate-100">
                <a href="/dashboard"
                   class="bg-slate-500 text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-600 focus:outline-none transition text-xs font-semibold">
                    Cancelar
                </a>
                <button type="submit"
                   class="bg-blue-600 text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-700 focus:outline-none transition text-xs font-semibold shadow-md shadow-blue-100">
                    Guardar Profesor
                </button>
            </div>

        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>